  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "When you make a melee attack against a target that has one or more of your allies adjacent to it, compare the result to the target's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fortitude_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fortitude Defense\">Fortitude Defense</a> as well as its <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a>. If the attack hits both <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Defenses\" title=\"Defenses\">Defenses</a>, the target's Speed is reduced by 2 squares and it takes a -2 penalty to its <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a> until the end of your next turn.",
